{"about":["Promising the Sabotage touch in every system, Sea of Stars aims to modernize the classic RPG in terms of turn-based combat, storytelling, exploration and interactions with the environment, while still offering a hearty slice of nostalgia and good old, simple fun.","Uses DUALSHOCK 4 vibration function","Offline multiplayer (2-3 players)","Offline play enabled","Enhanced game play on PS4 Pro console","Remote Play allows users to connect to and play games on their PlayStation®4 or PlayStation®5 using a mobile device, PC, or another PlayStation®4 or PlayStation®5.","One-time licence fee to download to multiple PS4 systems. Sign in to PlayStation is not required to use this on your primary PS4, but is required for use on other PS4 systems.","See Health Warnings for important health information before using this product."],"shots":[{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202308/0917/68696b21ffc4c3cfd57b6750f551c6de16f3906e8d8e71f2.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202308/0917/68696b21ffc4c3cfd57b6750f551c6de16f3906e8d8e71f2.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202308/0917/c768cda2cf0454802ce29bf90a0cbd8cf9afe456882931bc.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202308/0917/c768cda2cf0454802ce29bf90a0cbd8cf9afe456882931bc.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202207/0713/XknyBOgeGfK99wdfVQoJOujl.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202207/0713/XknyBOgeGfK99wdfVQoJOujl.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202207/0713/YVOzucS2VaUySEWAqkoAnlUp.jpg?w=1920&thumb=false","thumb":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202207/0713/YVOzucS2VaUySEWAqkoAnlUp.jpg?w=600&thumb=false"},{"url":"https://image.api.playstation.com/vulcan/ap/rnd/202308/0917/d8f2362930d9f49d790f98a4291df087c3d93039efd67a4